# Interpretation: the FPGA-facing segment reported Gen2 x4, while the ASMedia
# upstream segment and kernel bandwidth message reported Gen1 x1 as limiting.
# Separate XDMA timing evidence is incompatible with a Gen1 x1 end-to-end limit,
# so these fields are not accepted as a measured throughput result.
# Endpoint LnkSta alone must not be used to claim Gen2 x4 host throughput.
# Snapshot equality is not a long-duration stability result.
